  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">oPt CAP 2010 Christian Council of Sweden</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">oPt CAP 2010 Sv. Kristna R&#xe5;d (SKR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med Sidas st&#xf6;d till Sveriges Kristna R&#xe5;ds f&#xf6;ljeslagareprogram &#xe4;r ett &#xf6;kad skydd f&#xf6;r utsatta palestinier samt minskad risk f&#xf6;r v&#xe5;ldsanv&#xe4;ndning. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade reslutat &#xe4;r 1) &#xf6;kad r&#xf6;rlighet och tillg&#xe4;nglihet vid &apos;checkpoints&apos;. 2) Minskade brott mot internationell humanit&#xe4;r r&#xe4;tt. 3) Medvetenhet hos svenska beslutsfattare, journlister och civila samh&#xe4;llet (informationsdel)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: Decrease violations of HR and IHL in Pal. and Isr., providing protection by preventive presence and accompaniment in communities and areas where people are vulnerable to those violations. Expected results: 1.Improve access and freedom of movement of people at checkpoints and gates. 2.Reduce IHL violations. 3.Awareness of Swed. decision-makers, journalists and Civil Society.</narrative>
  </description>
